      "description": "The final candidate completes the existing preview presentation synchronously after old full-frame/canvas withdrawal when the current preview does not already own the shared detail. This handles both an invalid preview needing a fresh snapshot and a still-current preview whose shared detail belonged to the withdrawing refined sky."
    }
