  "sourceAnalysis": {
    "boundedDelta": "Authored native-host clear only, plus deterministic generated native-sky.js and offline.html. No styles, lunar geometry, terrain data, lunar physics, weather/radar freshness, source timestamps or core preview renderer changed.",
    "ownership": "previewOwnsDetail requires preview.frame.current() and the atmospheric-preview skyOwner. An already-current preview-owned detail and its pixels are preserved. Otherwise obsolete detail is cleared and existing preview.update() is invoked once after full canvas/frame withdrawal, before status publication.",
    "retainedChecks": "The unchanged update owner checks accepted input, hidden/paused state, exact target/generation/age, final publication headroom and bounded retry. It either republishes a still-current original-UTC image or computes a fresh accepted-UTC preview; it does not relabel stale pixels as new.",
    "whyPriorConditionalWasInsufficient": "Calling update only for !previewCurrent misses a current preview whose shared lunar detail belongs to refined-sky and has just been cleared. The second genuine RED asserted visible detail before withdrawal returns while preserving its original UTC.",
    "limits": "This is a controlled source/publication contract. It does not certify every possible clear reason, every Moon availability state or every physical compositor frame. Existing cold-start terrain-unavailable behavior remains separately bounded."
  },
